Low Density Housing - Addition / Alteration - Building Permit for DP-2016-00505 Including the Heritage Alteration Permit dated October 13, 2017  and in accordance with Section 4.4 of the Zoning and Development By-law, your request is granted, thereby permitting:

- change of use of the existing 560 sq. ft. detached accessory building from garage to pool cabana;
- to perform exterior and interior alteration to the existing accessory building (update and change windows and floor layout);
- exterior alterations to the pathway adjacent to the accessory building; 
- add a retaining wall and fountain feature between the accessory building and pool,

Cabana building to be sprinklered to NFPA 13D as >50m2
                                                                               
as shown on Drawings A0, A1.0, A-1.1, A-1.2, A-1.3, L-1.0, L-1.1 submitted by Phase One Design stamped "RECEIVED" by this Department on October 4, 2017 and now  APPROVED as a Minor Amendment to Development Permit Number DE215227.                                                              

B1/B2 - R. ANDREW GRAY, P.ENG. 604-319-3503 - STRUCTURAL

Low Density Housing - Addition / Alteration - Building Permit for DP-2016-00154. Scope of work includes exterior and interior alterations in this existing multiple-conversion dwelling containing a one-family dwelling with secondary suite thereby permitting;
- minor layout changes;
- raise the main floor by 1';
- kitchen upgrades; and
- exterior siding replacement

High Density Housing / Commercial - Addition / Alteration - Exterior alterations for building envelope repair to this existing six-storey Multiple Dwelling residential building, thereby providing the following alterations:
- replace existing stucco cladding to non-combustible EIFS cladding system; 
- replace existing canopy and skylights;
- replace waterproofing assembly at balcony and install new tempered glass guardrails;
- replace all windows and sliding doors (same sizes) on all floors;
- new aluminum privacy screens and 6' ht. guard with privacy tempered glazing at ground floor patio; 
- deck assembly replacements.

Building Review Note:
- Landscape changes proposed are approved under separate DP-2019-00151. 
Sch-A, Schedule B - Arch & Struct. and Schedule D-1 are submitted.

Field Review - Addition / Alteration - Interior alterations to remove non-bearing pony walls on the 2nd floor of this existing general office building on this site.

OK for field review as per Jamie Zhang, Apr.23/19

Energy upgrade selected: L2 - Lighting - Upgrade to incorporate space control systems (per 9.4.1.2 of ASHRAE 90.1-2010);
